kground-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(73, 80, 87);\">: we do our best to accurately test and describe these items; note that we use a Presidium gem tester which cannot distinguish between natural and lab-created gemstones. </span><strong style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(73, 80, 87);\">Large jewelry grab bags</strong><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(73, 80, 87);\"> ship in bulk form and individual items are not wrapped; these lots may include broken and partial items--returns are not accepted.</span></p><p>-----</p><p><strong style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(73, 80, 87);\">Sales tax </strong><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(73, 80, 87);\">is automatically applied by shopgoodwill.com and cannot be removed or reduced. If you feel you qualify for sales tax exemption you must request shopgoodwill.com to approve and apply it to your account. We cannot do that for you and will not remove sales tax from any order. Contact user@example.test for more information.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(73, 80, 87);\">-----</span></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(73, 80, 87);\">We do not cancel bids </strong><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(73, 80, 87);\">on closed auctions.</span></p>",
